//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// ---- Garage & Vehicle Editor ----
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

//* || VH ID ---- X ---- Y ---- Z ---- H ---- ForceSpawn? ---- Immediate Spawn ---- DMG Proof ---- Colours ---- FF ----||
//* Colours can be  0-94	||	00-5E - see colors.dat
//* Vehicles can be 130-236	||	82-EC - see default.ide
//* Each Line = +4 Bytes (except colours 1 -> 2 is +1byte.)
//Line 1 	=	Vehicle ID
//Line 2 	=	X -FLOAT-
//Line 3 	=	Y -FLOAT-
//Line 4 	=	Z -FLOAT-
//Line 5 	=	H -FLOAT-
//Line 6 	=	Spawn time 	- Sometimes this is spawn time etc - depends on parked, heli-pad, garage.
//Line 7 	=	00000010	- Spawn time - Immediate Spawn - depends on parked, heli-pad, garage.
//Line 8 	=	Damage Proof - 1F -
//Line 9a 	=	Colour 1 (& Colour 2)
//Line 9b 	=	Colours 2 (Stripe)	- +1 Byte
//Line 10 	=   000000FF || 0000FFFF == Available - with immediate spawn

